 to her first mission, but finds herself caught in a dark conspiracy――.<br><br>【VOICE】<br><br>Gekkamaru……Wataru Hatano\t\t<br>Kuroyuki……Hiro Shimono\t\t<br>Chōjirō Momochi……Kohsuke Toriumi<br>Hanzō Hattori……Kenjiro Tsuda\t\t<br>Goemon Ishikawa……Hikaru Midorikawa<br>\t\t\t\t<br>Ennosuke Yamakura……Ryo Oshima\t\t<br>Kyara Mikumo……Saori Hayami\t\t<br>Kasumi……Megumi Han\t\t<br>Ieyasu Tokugawa……Kouki Miyata<br>and more.<br><br>Heroine has no voice sound. (This is a specification.)<br><br><br>【About Theme song】<br><br>Opening Theme<br>&quot;Gekka no Uta ha Kage yorimo Kuroku（月下の唄は影よりも黒く）&quot; MIKOTO<br><br><br>Ending Theme<br>&quot;Taezaru Hana（絶えざる花）&quot;（TRUE END）MIKOTO<br>&quot;Aoi Sange（蒼い散華）&quot;（BAD END）MIKOTO<br><br>On sale at itunes!<br><br><br><br>【About Memoirs】<br>Each memoir will be opened by reading all the scenarios (sentences).",
